# sdxl-bf16.recipe -- Stable Diffusion XL (and its finetunes: Illustrious, NoobAI, Pony, ...) at bf16.
#
#   rad-convert <checkpoint>.safetensors --tokenizer <CLIP tokenizer.json> \
#       --recipe data/recipes/sdxl-bf16.recipe -o sdxl.rad
#
# A single-file SDXL checkpoint (Stability's layout) ships its weights f16, some finetunes partly
# bf16 or f32; every weight the model reads is served bf16. The VAE's encoder, the text encoders'
# unused tails and the checkpoint's bookkeeping tensors are not carried.
*                                    cast dtype=bf16
